diffusers\r\ndiffusers                         0.27.2\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. restart ComfyUI\r\n\r\n4. Install custom_nodes [StableZero123-comfyui](https://github.com/deroberon/StableZero123-comfyui)\r\n\r\nThe requirements.txt in this repo has this [line](https://github.com/deroberon/StableZero123-comfyui/blob/main/requirements.txt#L1) `diffusers~=0.21.4`\r\n\r\n5. check diffusers version again\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ pip list | grep diffusers\r\ndiffusers                         0.21.4\r\n```\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ltdrdata","id":128333288,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6Y16A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128333288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata","html_url":"https://github.com/ltdrdata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ltdrdata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI-Manager/issues/1301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI-Manager/issues/1301/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI-Manager/issues/473","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI-Manager","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy